"head-lede","children":"The full guide from the video. Skip the 300 agents. Use the one you already have, give it a map and one folder per job, and write the proof before the playbook, so a new model costs you a few lines instead of a week. Starter folder and all five prompts included."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"head-action","children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/my-agent.zip","download":true,"className":"btn-primary px-6 py-3 text-sm","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":true,"children":"↓"}]," ","Download the starter folder"]}]}]]}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"cover","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/covers/folder-method-one-ai-agent.webp","width":1200,"height":800,"alt":"","fetchPriority":"high","decoding":"async"}],["$","canvas",null,{"aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"sheet","children":[["$","canvas",null,{"className":"seam","data-seam":"#F5F2EA","aria-hidden":"true"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pad sheet-in","children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"read guide","children":["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"mt-5 text-lg leading-[1.75] text-ink","children":"This is the whole setup from the video: the folder, the map, the three files in every job, and the five prompts that write them. Download the starter folder with the button at the top, or build it by hand with the command further down."}],["$","h2","1",{"className":"mt-12 t-h3 text-ink","children":"Why your agent keeps breaking"}],["$","p","2",{"className":"mt-5 text-lg leading-[1.75] text-ink","children":"You've seen the localhost demos with 300 agents running an entire business. They burn tokens, and every agent in them runs on a prompt someone tuned for one model. When the next model drops, nothing crashes. It just quietly gets worse. A study of 5,669 bug reports across agent frameworks found 76% of them were silent wrong output, with no error at all. You find out from a customer."}],["$","p","3",{"className":"mt-5 text-lg leading-[1.75] text-ink","children":"Most of the frameworks those demos were built on got retired or rewritten in the last year:"}],["$","div","4",{"className":"mt-7 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-line bg-bg-soft/50","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full min-w-[420px] border-collapse text-left","children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th","0",{"className":"border-b border-line-strong px-5 py-3.5 font-mono text-[12px] text-accent-soft","children":"Date"}],"$L17"]}]}],"$L18"]}]}],"$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31","$L32","$L33","$L34","$L35","$L36","$L37","$L38","$L39","$L3a","$L3b","$L3c","$L3d","$L3e","$L3f","$L40","$L41","$L42","$L43","$L44","$L45","$L46","$L47","$L48","$L49","$L4a","$L4b","$L4c"]}]}],"$L4d"]}]]}],"$L4e"]
